sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Merch as Merchandiser
  participant API as Recommendation API
  participant Service as Recommendation service
  participant Evidence as Frozen evidence reader
  participant Eligibility as Live eligibility service
  participant DB as Database
  Merch->>API: Generate from completed run / request expiry push
  API->>Service: Validate role, store and request
  Service->>Evidence: Load frozen patterns/provenance (mining path)
  Evidence-->>Service: Immutable source evidence
  Service->>Eligibility: Check current product and inventory eligibility
  Eligibility-->>Service: Current status and warnings
  Service->>DB: Insert deduplicated PENDING_REVIEW candidate and source links
  DB-->>Service: Candidate ID
  Service-->>API: Generation result
  API-->>Merch: Candidate and eligibility details
  Merch->>API: Approve/reject with expected version and reason
  API->>Service: Review decision
  Service->>Eligibility: Recheck live eligibility
  Service->>DB: Compare version/state, persist review and history
  DB-->>Service: Updated candidate
  Service-->>Merch: Review result
